invariant: INV-59
file: mldsa_poly.c
catches: mldsa_test
reason: the norm check admits a z coefficient of exactly gamma1 - beta,
  which FIPS 204 Algorithm 8 refuses, since it requires the infinity norm
  below that bound. bin/mldsa_test's edge coefficient of gamma1 - beta
  then decodes as under the bound.

--- old
        if (z0 >= bound || z0 <= -bound || z1 >= bound || z1 <= -bound) {
--- new
        if (z0 > bound || z0 < -bound || z1 > bound || z1 < -bound) {
